{{!-- ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     NAV ICON
     Ghost menu labels are user-defined, so the slug is all we get. This maps
     the slugs a creator site actually uses onto the sprite, and renders
     NOTHING for anything else — an icon keyed blindly to an arbitrary slug
     leaves a hole beside every item we did not anticipate.

     Add a row to extend it. Only usable inside {{#foreach navigation}}.
     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --}}
